      "webhookId": "dmc-output-0010",
      "notes": "This path MUST stay 'renderer-output' — it is the REPORT_GENERATOR_WEBHOOK the renderer ships to. Receives multipart: binary pdf + idml, form field 'payload' (outcome JSON). Query params carry record_id/client_slug from the kickoff."
